OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright or sunny intervals and
OL,6,Ffurther showers, most frequent in west
OL,7,Fbut becoming more scattered in the
OL,8,Fafternoon as the fresh southwesterly
OL,9,Fwinds continue to ease down.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FShowers becoming light and
OL,12,Fmore confined to the northwest though
OL,13,Fbecoming mostly cloudy. The east
OL,14,Fbecoming mainly dry with a few clear
OL,15,Fintervals.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FMainly dry, though rather
OL,18,Fcloudy at times with a few light
OL,19,Fshowers. Some sunshine around too the
OL,20,Fbest along the east coast and the
OL,21,Fnortheast. Far west breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
